      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The person that has the avatar you want can simply give you the unity package file through discord or websites like dropbox or mediafire. Allowing people to download anyone’s avatar that they personally made would be a totally wrong thing to do, especially without their permission. Implementing this option would essentially give a complete stranger access to my avatar that I worked hard on and put hours upon hours of work into.",
      "viewerReactions": null
