  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-06-26T13:10:51.099Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I have a small suggestion to add to VrChat, so when your friend has a avatar that you want on your account you have to give them your login information. In my opinion, that isn’t very safe, I think you guys should add a system to VrChat where your friends can give you a avatar without giving them your login information. Maybe you should make a way where you can download their avatar to your account from their profile and they can set it so friends only can download their avatar, or anyone can click their profile and download it.",
